1
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,330
Delicious, really delicious.

2
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:02,690
Try this.

3
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:05,680
It's good.

4
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:11,610
Who is it?

5
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,140
A spam call.

6
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,520
It must be a man calling.

7
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,320
Kid,

8
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,400
you can't do two things at once.

9
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,080
Got it?

10
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,640
I am not a kid.

11
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:25,600
This kid is just like you when you were little.

12
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,330
Likes playing games alone too.

13
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,039
I am not a kid.

14
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:30,560
No, no, no.

15
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,880
When I was little, all you cared about was dating,

16
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,940
and you ignored me.

17
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,440
You used to say

18
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:40,250
Qian Cheng is a jerk, but I didn't believe you.

19
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:42,200
A kid's eye is really sharp.

20
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,240
Now you know.

21
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:46,240
Important things must be said three times.

22
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,759
I am not a kid.

23
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,680
Also,

24
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:52,000
not all men are jerks.

25
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,800
You mean your father?

26
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:54,800
I'm talking about

27
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,440
Zhang Yang.

28
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,640
A kid's eye is really sharp.

29
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,660
Kids have terrible taste.

30
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,840
You can rent a tent for 50 bucks.

31
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:22,000
Why do you have to set it up yourself?

32
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,320
If I do it myself, I don't even need 50.

33
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,160
Then give me 25.

34
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:33,160
You're talking in your sleep before you even go to bed.

35
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,640
And that kid even said you were nice.

36
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,800
That's because I'm cute.

37
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:40,760
Pitiful and unloved.

38
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,880
Li Xinyue, you are really not cute.

39
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,730
I have no obligation to be cute.

40
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,980
Let me roast it.

41
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,300
You don't know how.

42
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,600
Who says I don't?

43
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:55,480
I did.

44
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,640
I'm going to roast it anyway.

45
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:59,840
Dangdang loved to sneak bites of roasted sweet potatoes.

46
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,360
Dangdang?

47
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,400
Dangdang would have been twelve

48
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,360
in just two days.

49
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,860
Were you dating a younger guy?

50
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,160
It was a dog.

51
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:21,960
Xiaoman.

52
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:26,040
The average lifespan of a dog is ten years.

53
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,400
Twelve is already a very long life.

54
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:30,360
Really.

55
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,040
Thanks.

56
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,600
I don't need comfort.

57
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:46,320
I just need some time to process my emotions.

58
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:50,000
I regret it a little.

59
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:51,800
Why?

60
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,600
For half a year after his diagnosis,

61
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,960
I strictly limited his diet.

62
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:01,200
His favorite dried sweet potatoes,

63
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,120
cream cups,

64
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,450
and chew sticks,

65
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,570
he couldn't eat any of them.

66
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:11,240
He was often very unhappy about it.

67
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,280
Last week,

68
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:17,040
on the way to get him cremated,

69
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,860
I suddenly felt so full of regret.

70
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,760
I wish I had let him eat them,

71
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:24,970
even just a little bite.

72
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,200
Whether a dog or a human,

73
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,360
while we are alive,

74
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,240
we should really enjoy life.

75
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,440
Shouldn't we?

76
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,920
Maybe this is a punishment.

77
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,290
A punishment for not treating Dangdang well.

78
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,320
So,

79
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,409
all the sadness it took away

80
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:58,720
was returned to me after it left.

81
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,280
That day,

82
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:05,250
didn't that little dog we met, Doudou,

83
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,920
look exactly like Dangdang?

84
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,360
Go make a wish.

85
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,640
Tomorrow

86
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,200
is your last day in Nan'an.

87
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,159
Well,

88
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
where is there a place to make a wish?

89
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,640
I heard that the stones here

90
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,770
are very effective for making wishes.

91
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,400
Make a wish.

92
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,210
After making a wish,

93
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,690
throw it over there.

94
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,640
Will a wish come true if I make one?

95
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,240
Sincerity makes it work.

96
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:00,930
Give it a try.

97
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,880
What did you wish for?

98
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,970
Why does it look so much like Dangdang?

99
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,000
This dog,

100
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,860
did you prepare it?

101
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:48,800
No.

102
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,480
Maybe

103
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,380
wishing on the stones here

104
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,409
really made the wish come true.

105
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,960
The kid really has good taste.

106
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:07,650
What did you say?

107
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,640
I won't tell you.

108
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,040
How can she be so cute?

109
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,360
This is so frustrating.

110
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,200
It's so unfair.

111
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:38,520
I totally took the bait.

112
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,920
Keep it down.

113
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,680
Walls have ears.

114
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:49,120
Aren't you reacting a bit too mildly?

115
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,320
It's your reaction that's too extreme, Mr. Zhang.

116
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,520
If a good friend

117
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,040
suddenly gives you a cold look,

118
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,040
you'd also want to know what they're thinking, right?

119
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,320
Is that so?

120
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,040
Just like the other day when I was changing the living room light bulb.

121
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,840
Mr. Zhang suddenly gave me a cold look.

122
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,370
I really wanted to know why.

123
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,520
I think it's because when you were changing the bulb,

124
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:09,680
you suddenly showed your abs,

125
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,680
and Xinyue took a few extra glances.

126
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:14,000
Wait, why are you here again?

127
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,420
That's not important.

128
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,360
Can't Mr. Zhang confess his feelings first?

129
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,840
Of course not.

130
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,840
The one who confesses first loses.

131
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,880
When playing Fight the Landlord,

132
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,120
would you throw out the Rocket right at the start?

133
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,360
Unless I'm crazy.

134
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,920
Exactly.

135
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:33,320
The person who reveals their hand first becomes passive.

136
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,320
Are they scolding me?

137
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:48,280
No.

138
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,640
Really?

139
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:50,960
If they are,

140
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,370
they're cursing you to die.

141
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,720
I thought that would be funny.

142
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:00,920
This one is funnier.

143
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,040
Then what should we do next, Mr. Zhang?

144
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,100
Should we stick to the original plan?

145
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,920
We will face whatever comes.

146
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,400
Who's afraid of whom?

147
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,840
Trump card.

148
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,880
Why are you so excited?

149
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,690
I wasn't talking about you.

150
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:24,820
I was talking about my ex-boyfriend.

151
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,000
Back to the topic.

152
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:31,040
Anyway, even if you like Mr. Zhang,

153
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:33,360
you shouldn't confess first.

154
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,000
But

155
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:38,520
you can create situations for him to take the initiative.

156
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,600
If it's convenient for you.

157
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,240
I can show you around nearby right now.

158
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,170
Okay. Thank you.

159
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:50,160
Welcome to Chenggong Travel Agency. Please register here.

160
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,090
Okay. Thank you.

161
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,400
We have customized some short-trip routes for you.

162
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:55,920
This way, please.

163
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,240
What's going on today?

164
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:00,450
Why are there suddenly so many customers?

165
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,520
Look at this.

166
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:07,800
Xiaoman, did you have fun on your last trip?

167
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,160
I'm so happy.

168
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:11,880
I highly recommend the staff at Chenggong Travel Agency.

169
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,760
They are super considerate and reliable.

170
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:16,000
If you visit Nan'an, you must find them.

171
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,120
I didn't expect

172
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,640
Yang Xiaoman to be a pet blogger.

173
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,920
Ever since she adopted that puppy,

174
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:26,000
she posted her experience online.

175
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,600
She praised us a lot,

176
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:28,900
and then we went viral.

177
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:29,880
Yeah.

178
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:32,400
I didn't expect a little kid to make us go viral.

179
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,200
That's great!

180
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:35,960
Now more people know about Chenggong Travel Agency.

181
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,840
Our travel agency is going to be rich.

182
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,840
Making a fortune.

183
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,600
Looks like another customer is here.

184
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,760
And a beauty too.

185
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,520
Is Li Yiying here?

186
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,920
Hello. Why are you looking for my sister?

187
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,040
It's business.

188
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,040
It's Shasha.

189
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,080
What Shasha?

190
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,480
My name is Qianqian.

191
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,320
Qian from Nie Xiaoqian.

192
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,040
A fox spirit.

193
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,680
A female ghost.

194
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:03,240
Right.

195
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:05,840
Li Yiying, let's not mince words.

196
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:08,760
You have to hand over this building.

197
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,800
Why should I?

198
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:10,810
Don't play dumb.

199
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,080
Qian Cheng is a fool.

200
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,840
But I'm not.

201
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,360
This is your joint property.

202
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,890
Why do you get to take it all?

203
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:19,800
The divorce agreement states clearly in black and white

204
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:22,640
that the property rights to this building belong to me.

205
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,440
You tricked him into signing it.

206
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,770
It doesn't count at all.

207
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,800
If Qian Cheng has objections, he can sue in court.

208
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,560
Who are you to talk to me?

209
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,840
I am his girlfriend,

210
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,880
and we are getting married soon.

211
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,760
Have a happy marriage.

212
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:39,200
Miss,

213
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,000
if you don't have any business to attend to,

214
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,760
please don't interfere with our work.

215
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,720
According to the Public Security Administration Punishments Law,

216
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,480
disturbing public order

217
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:49,340
is punishable by a warning or a fine of up to 200 yuan.

218
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,640
Do you want me to call the police?

219
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:51,720
Some people

220
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,480
are just too greedy.

221
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,920
Then,

222
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:56,000
see her out.

223
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,720
Just you wait.

224
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,600
You are not welcome back.

225
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,240
Don't worry, sis.

226
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,200
I'll go make money right now.

227
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,480
I'll hire a security guard

228
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,140
to keep this kind of trash out.

229
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:09,160
What the hell.

230
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:10,960
Just ignore that kind of person.

231
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,240
You and Zhang Yang...

232
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,880
Who confessed first, you or Zhang Yang?

233
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,720
Who told you that nonsense, sis?

234
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,400
Don't worry about who said it.

235
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:35,520
I just want to be your wingman.

236
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:36,400
How about this?

237
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,600
You, me, and Lin Yiyi.

238
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,500
Three on three.

239
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,780
Fair competition.

240
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,240
Three on three?

241
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:43,400
I'm not that desperate yet.

242
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,400
I managed to get from your ex-brother-in-law

243
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,860
this building as my share.

244
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:08,020
Why are you copying me?

245
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:10,800
Did you know

246
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:13,000
that when Yang Xiaoman boarded the plane,

247
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,400
she sent me a message?

248
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,130
What did she say?

249
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,320
She said,

250
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,570
"Thank you."

251
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:20,840
As for the puppy,

252
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,560
she named it Little Stone.

253
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,360
Little Stone.

254
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:38,360
So why have you been arguing with me lately?

255
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,560
I...

256
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,560
Forget it.

257
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,040
Anyway,

258
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,480
Because I was afraid.

259
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:51,890
I was afraid you'd think

260
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:54,280
this Zhang Yang

261
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,760
isn't flamboyant at all.

262
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:03,320
But I think this Zhang Yang is great.

263
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:08,240
Much better than when you're being pretentious.

264
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,160
Really?

265
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:10,480
Just kidding.

266
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,660
So next time I'm afraid of something,

267
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,120
I can just say it out loud

268
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,850
without having to tough it out.

269
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,480
High five.

270
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,240
What is this?

271
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:28,730
A high five as a promise.

272
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,040
Come here.

273
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:33,960
Zhang Yang,

274
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:36,120
get over here.
